fin(s,'Printed page 197: the page is cropped at the left edge in the scan, so the last words of every line are cut off; the gaps are marked “…”. The end of the Majlis-e-Shura (the second house) and the start of “خلیفہ کی کابینہ” (printed heading; the cabinet and the ministers). The scan shows a handwritten circled numeral; excluded. Needs checking against a complete scan.')
